      "block_preview_text": "Cherries are kept in a cold room for at least 24 to 48 hours before packaging. Green chilis are sorted by size and color for processing. Red chilis are harvested once at the end of the season for packaging and shipping. Watermelons are harvested when they are mature and will be flipped over to indicate readiness.",
